        "text_free": "那要啷子搞呢？今天我们就总结了一些小知识。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 11.179,
      "end": 14.218,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "告诉大家应该如何避险。",
      "score": 0.1375,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0349,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0308,
        "sc_delta": 0.0041,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.089,
        "seg_cer": 0.2,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "告诉大家，应该用火避险。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.607,
      "end": 17.252,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "暴雨天出行应该如何避险？",
      "score": 0.0831,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0079,
        "sc_logprob": -0.009,
        "sc_delta": -0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.182,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "暴雨天出行，应该游河避险。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 17.252,
      "end": 19.66,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "一、及时到安全的室内避雨，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0036,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0043,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一，及时到安全的室内避雨。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 19.66,
      "end": 22.911,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "积水漫进屋内应该及时切断电源。",
      "score": 0.038,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0111,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0099,
        "sc_delta": 0.0011,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.01,
        "seg_cer": 0.071,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "积水漫进屋内，应该及时的切断电源。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 23.26,
      "end": 27.002,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "二、尽量结伴而行，切记莫冒险涉水。",
      "score": 0.3717,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1318,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1321,
        "sc_delta": -0.0002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.407,
        "seg_cer": 0.571,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "恶尽量戒扮恶行，千寂寞毛险涉水。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 27.144,
      "end": 30.928,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "三、避免和金属物体接触，防止触电。",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.003,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0036,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "三，避免和金属物体接触，防止触电。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 31.123,
      "end": 34.94,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "四、不要在高楼或者是大型的广告牌下面躲雨，",
      "score": 0.4564,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2328,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1911,
        "sc_delta": 0.0417,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.739,
        "seg_cer": 0.158,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "四，不要再搞了，或者是大型的广告牌下面躲雨。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 34.94,
      "end": 37.419,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "避免坠物砸伤。五、",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0031,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0039,
        "sc_delta": -0.0007,
